# Roll-Rule CTA Comparison Skill

When the user asks to compare futures roll rules, audit roll cost or roll gaps, reproduce a CTA roll ledger, or explain how roll timing changes real contract PnL, use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/roll-cta
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/roll-cta/SKILL.md`.
2. For API fields and data contracts, read `.cursor/skills/roll-cta/references/api_guide.md`.
3. Use the local `pandadata-api` skill to verify method parameters before any real API call.
4. Set PANDA_DATA_USERNAME and PANDA_DATA_PASSWORD before fetching data, or pass `config["data_dir"]`.
5. Preserve product universe, date range, cost assumptions, roll thresholds, and data dates.
6. Do not invent data interfaces, fields, prices, or trading advice.
